CONTENT

Practice questions, glossary entries, drills and topic articles in this
repository are original works written against publicly published certification
exam objectives. They are not reproductions of any exam, question bank, or other
copyrighted material belonging to a certification provider, and they are not
actual exam questions.

Files under docs/cert-objectives/ are summaries of publicly published objective
documents, retained for traceability. They are descriptive references, not
redistributions of the providers' documents. Consult the official published
objectives before relying on them.
